",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-3 mt-4 text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"How AIBlockList evaluates social media activity using verifiable behavioral signals, peer-reviewed fairness research, and mandatory human review — without relying on flawed AI text detectors.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":22,\"height\":22,\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 256 256\",\"transform\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[false,\"$undefined\",\"$L7\"]}],\"$L8\"]}],\"$L9\",\"$La\"]}],\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\"]}],null,\"$Le\"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],\"$Lf\",false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$10\",[]],\"s\":false,\"S\":true}\n14:I[4431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n16:I[5278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\n18:I[4431,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n1a:I[4431,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n1b:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n7:[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M128,20A108,108,0,1,0,236,128,108.12,108.12,0,0,0,128,20Zm0,192a84,84,0,1,1,84-84A84.09,84.09,0,0,1,128,212Zm-12-80V80a12,12,0,0,1,24,0v52a12,12,0,0,1-24,0Zm28,40a16,16,0,1,1-16-16A16,16,0,0,1,144,172Z\"}]\n8:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-4 text-white\",\"children\":\"Why AI Text Detectors Are Strictly Prohibited\"}]\n9:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-3 text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"In 2023, Stanford researchers demonstrated that popular AI writing detectors systematically misclassify non-native English writing as AI-generated at rates exceeding 61%. Stylometric detectors measure sentence perplexity and vocabulary distribution — penalizing careful, formal, or ESL grammar while easily failing against adversarial prompts.\"}]\na:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4 font-mono caption-4 text-zinc-400 space-y-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"Policy Principle 2.2:\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"\\\"The platform must never treat writing style, grammar quality, formal tone, English proficiency, AI-generated text probabilities, or third-party AI detection scores as standalone evidence.\\\"\"}]]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"The 5 Behavioral Signals\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-4 mt-1 text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Every classification requires repeatable behavioral proof observed across public thread URLs.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"SIG-01\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#313131]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 rounded border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono font-bold text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":\"SIG-01\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"Near-Duplicate Unsolicited Replies\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-5 rounded border border-[#313131] bg-[#1f1f1f] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Primary classification trigger.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":[\"Threshold: \",\"3 or more replies with ≥ 0.90 cosine similarity across unrelated authors within 7 days\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 mt-3 text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Detects copy-paste spam loops while permitting genuine conversational consistency. Calculates TF-IDF and character n-gram cosine similarity across reply bodies.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"SIG-02\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#313131]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 rounded border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono font-bold text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":\"SIG-02\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"Structural Template Loops\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-5 rounded border border-[#313131] bg-[#1f1f1f] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Primary classification trigger.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":[\"Threshold: \",\"5 or more replies in 14 days matching an identical structural clause skeleton\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 mt-3 text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Exposes synonym-rotated spambots that swap adjectives while keeping the exact pitch skeleton intact (e.g., 'Loved this insight! Check out my bio for more!').\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"SIG-03\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#313131]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 rounded border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono font-bold text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":\"SIG-03\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"Unsolicited Fan-Out Ratio\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-5 rounded border border-[#313131] bg-[#1f1f1f] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Corroborative trigger (must pair with SIG-01 or SIG-02).\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":[\"Threshold: \",\"≥ 20 daily replies with ≥ 90% non-mutual targets and < 5% follow-up dialogue turns\"]}],\"$L11\"]}],\"$L12\",\"$L13\"]}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"The 4-Point Publication Gate\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold\",\"children\":\"GATE 1\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"≥ 2 Distinct URLs\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-6 text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"No account can enter the core verified blocklist on a single isolated post. Two distinct behavioral URLs are required to verify a persistent pattern.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold\",\"children\":\"GATE 2\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Human Dual Review\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-6 text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Accounts with 10,000+ followers or verified organization credentials require two independent human reviewers before publication.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold\",\"children\":\"GATE 3\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Zero Raw Text Archiving\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-6 text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"To protect privacy and honor platform deletion rules, AIBlockList persists only canonical post URLs, platform post IDs, and SHA-256 hashes. Raw text is discarded.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold\",\"children\":\"GATE 4\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Cryptographic Audit Chain\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-6 text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Every reviewer action, appeal status change, and policy update is immutably linked via an append-only SHA-256 hash chain publicly verifiable on the Transparency Ledger.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-1 border-b border-[#272727] pb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-4 uppercase text-[#ff6600] font-bold font-mono\",\"children\":\"Ecosystem Philosophy\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"heading-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Noise vs. Substance & The Course-Correction Doctrine\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#111] p-5 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Is It Really About AI, or Low-Value Noise?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 text-zinc-300 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Human attention is finite and expensive. When generative AI makes drafting text virtually free, creators are tempted to flood replies with automated affirmations simply to satisfy algorithmic velocity. Processing zero-value noise creates cognitive exhaustion.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-6 text-zinc-400 font-sans\",\"children\":[\"AIBlockList does not police authorship style or AI writing assistance. We strictly target\",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\" unsolicited programmatic noise loops\"}],\" that siphon human attention without contributing substance.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#111] p-5 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"The Course-Correction Guarantee\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 text-zinc-300 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Punitive mass blocking without transparency creates resentment and locks users into permanent exclusion. Because recommendation algorithms actively reward rapid replies, many creators unintentionally fall into bot-like patterns.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-6 text-zinc-400 font-sans\",\"children\":\"Everyone deserves a transparent chance to course-correct. That is why AIBlockList provides observable evidence links, pre-flight quality testing, and a free bio verification challenge with automated delisting.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"children\":[\"$L15\",[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"promise\":\"$@17\"}]]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":\"$L19\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1b\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":\"$L1c\"}]}]}]]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 mt-3 text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Distinguishes authentic community conversation from broadcast spray-and-pray farming. Always requires pairing with SIG-01 or SIG-02 to safeguard active human chatters.\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"div\",\"SIG-04\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#313131]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 rounded border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono font-bold text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":\"SIG-04\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"Coordinated Campaign Cluster\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-5 rounded border border-[#313131] bg-[#1f1f1f] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Primary classification trigger for coordinated manipulation.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":[\"Threshold: \",\"≥ 3 distinct accounts posting synchronized payloads within a 30-minute window\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 mt-3 text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Uncovers multi-account botnet syndicates amplifying the same commercial, crypto, or political targets in lockstep.\"}]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"div\",\"SIG-05\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#313131]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-3 rounded border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono font-bold text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":\"SIG-05\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"title-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"Cadence Anomaly & Velocity Burst\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"caption-5 rounded border border-[#313131] bg-[#1f1f1f] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Supporting only. Never classifies on its own.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\",\"children\":[\"Threshold: \",\"Median reply latency < 15 seconds across ≥ 10 diverse authors, or flat 24h posting over 72h\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"body-5 mt-3 text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Captures headless script execution. Crucially, speed alone NEVER triggers a classification — it only provides corroborating weight to structural signals.\"}]]}]\n19:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n15:null\n1d:I[622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n17:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Behavioral Verification Methodology — AIBlockList\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Deterministic behavioral signals SIG-01 to SIG-05 for identifying automated social spam without AI authorship detection scores.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"AIBlockList — Identify. Verify. Filter.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Open source trust and safety infrastructure separating abusive automation from genuine human and AI assisted communication.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://aiblocklist.com/logo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:image:width\",\"content\":\"1200\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:image:height\",\"content\":\"1200\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"AIBlockList Logo\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"website\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\"